### 5. and THIS branch, which pays in full
  .github/actions/changed-class/action.yml
  .github/workflows/ci.yml
  docs/roadmaps/roadmap.yaml
  scripts/ci/changed-class.sh
  tests/changed_class_fixture/mod.rs
  tests/falsification_pr_lane_runs_what_the_change_can_break.rs
  tests/falsification_pr_lane_selects_the_gate_the_change_can_move.rs
  -> code=true gate_c=true gate_d=true gates=C,D 
  .github/** is unclassified for the selection, so a change to the lane
  itself runs both gates. That is the allow-list failing in the direction
  it is supposed to fail in: this PR does not get to skip the gates it is
  changing the rules for.
